  "Tall posture, relaxed arms swinging naturally. Flat ground is best while symptoms are active. Two 5-minute walks count if 10 at once aggravates things.": {
    "file": "assets/coach/17ea46364d11081c.mp3",
    "duration": 10.74
  },
  "Walk. 10 minutes at an easy pace. Tall posture, relaxed arms swinging naturally.": {
    "file": "assets/coach/5915a82d1d7530aa.mp3",
    "duration": 5.213
  },
